description:
[Game reference] One vehicle: HP, damage taken, fuel, decay, price, repair cost, explosives to destroy. `hp`; `damage_taken` (% of each damage type it takes after its armour - 300% = triple); `fuel` (`per_min` at full
throttle, `idle_per_min`, `tank`, `tank_minutes`); `seats`, `storage_slots`; `decay` (each timer with its ConVar);
`buy` (scrap at the vendor), `craft`, `repair_full` (cost from near-zero to full); `explosives` (direct hits of each
explosive to destroy it from full HP); `engine` (kW / thrust, `max_speed_kmh` for trains); `horse` (gaits and breeds);
`convars` (the server settings behind the numbers, with their defaults). `modular-car` also returns `car`: chassis,
every module (HP, seats, engine kW, fuel use, storage, recipe) and engine parts by tier. Use for vehicle HP, fuel per minute, decay, vendor price, repair cost or 'how many rockets to kill a minicopter'. All vanilla defaults; servers can change the listed convars. Link https://rust.wiki/vehicles/<key>.
